{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TheParcel-Escape: Welcome to the daily 'Drug Pickup' and the eternal nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person game centered on <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> and <strong>Puzzle-Escape</strong>. You are a 35-year-old convalescent whose sole daily objective is to go to the parcel station and retrieve your life-sustaining medication. However, upon entry, the ordinary parcel station instantly shifts into one of the independent levels\u2014each a deep-seated memory imbued with a <strong>Chinese Dreamcore aesthetic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore these time-frozen, nostalgic spaces within the sanity time limit, find the hidden clues, solve the bizarre puzzles, ultimately retrieve the <strong>&quot;Parcel Code&quot; on the phone</strong>, unlock the only exit\u2014the parcel locker\u2014and escape to the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've returned to the past, but no one is here anymore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Eerie Beauty of Chinese Dreamcore:</strong> Immerse yourself in nostalgic Chinese settings from the late 90s to the early 00s. From childhood rooms to abandoned bookstores, every step treads on the ruins of memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Psychological Dread:</strong> The horror is not driven by cheap Jump Scares, but by a persistent &quot;Sense of Eerie Disconnect&quot; within the scenes\u2014what should be there is silently gone, and what shouldn't be is eerily static.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Pressure of Time and Sanity:</strong> You have a finite Sanity value (Mind value). The passage of time and specific pressure points during puzzle-solving will rapidly deplete it. You must strategically use your medication to buy more time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate and Non-Linear Puzzle Design:</strong> Puzzles are cleverly integrated with nostalgic environmental elements, challenging your observation and logic, avoiding simple, repetitive number locks or block-moving tasks.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Here it is!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/8eaf49779949edaefb6534640bf39ce98afc50bd.jpg"},{"name":"Childhood Memories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/426eb0d2eb03cf708b882e835d84327f59cefdc4.jpg"},{"name":"The Beginning of a Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/3805deba1772cea4f15a2a959a98efed39bc0b82.jpg"},{"name":"Study Hard, Improve Every Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/dd7afd48d4a448e7a27337436a6a255b31352fe5.jpg"},{"name":"A Simple Love Song","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/cebde6e97c0486570fb2f1e7d2b6669797b92cd7.jpg"},{"name":"Is This Homework Really Mandatory?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/4f998c770a3056646f4fd3a86c8e19d0d795ec77.jpg"},{"name":"Hunting Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/f2fc6fb1911c3ce41169cc2ae28771a87cb269e6.jpg"},{"name":"Halloween Magic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/0c7c2b02dd1292eb431b9e9e1ba54546951019ed.jpg"},{"name":"The Way Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/4dd1fcd347f1d2e70b2159bc563a98bc42eba66e.jpg"},{"name":"Slow Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131140/0eee6bab4961f19dae0ced7124d6a40e376b540f.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.c