e 90s to the early 00s. From childhood rooms to abandoned bookstores, every step treads on the ruins of memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtle Psychological Dread:</strong> The horror is not driven by cheap Jump Scares, but by a persistent &quot;Sense of Eerie Disconnect&quot; within the scenes\u2014what should be there is silently gone, and what shouldn't be is eerily static.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Pressure of Time and Sanity:</strong> You have a finite Sanity value (Mind value). The passage of time and specific pressure points during puzzle-solving will rapidly deplete it. You must strategically use your medication to buy more time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate and Non-Linear Puzzle Design:</strong> Puzzles are cleverly integrated with nostalgic environmental elements, challenging your observation and logic, avoiding simple, repetitive number locks or block-moving tasks.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Michi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131140/bd9a9b0fa278b7075acf8eb4e6d6eab222f6c3c0/header.jpg?t=1763982676","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4131140/1037242261/992aeac86610b5da75a7551a5f50a71e4ed50619/1761805718/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762338815","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4131140/1037242261/992aeac86610b5da75a7551a5f50a71e4ed50619/1761805718/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762338815","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4131140/1037242261/992aeac86610b5da75a7551a5f50a71e4ed50619/1761805718/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762338815","id":257224490,"name":"\u5148\u884c\u9884\u544aPV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224490/b429e44f65a751236134b36eb593e383d855fb11/movie_600x337.jp